    <string name="export_title">Keep this file private</string>
    <string name="export_warning">The file is saved unencrypted where you choose and contains the raw records: apps, hosts, addresses, times, DNS lookups, permission use and — if decryption (research build) was on — the content of requests and responses.

That content can include things other people sent you or that were sent about them: their messages, names, photos, locations and account details. They have not agreed to this. Keep the file private, do not upload or share it, and delete it when you no longer need it.</string>
